# Matterbending Mage's "up to one other target creature" is not an opponent's only: on turn 3 Bot1 returns its own Ornithopter
# to its hand (and so can recast it), and with no target at all (up to one) the trigger on turn 5, the second Mage, returns
# nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Matterbending Mage
Matterbending Mage
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

